          "text": "Ndipho mudzi mkpwulu wa Babeli uchiganyika seemu tahu na midzi mikulu ya mataifa ganjina ichibanangbwa-banangbwa yosi. Naye Mlungu kayayala kutiya adabu nyo mudzi wa Babeli. Mana waulazimisha ugbwabire chikombe cha uchi mufu wa tsukizize. ",
